"Mass Action Scheduler - Callout-Free Edition" is an independent, from-scratch
reimplementation inspired by the original "Mass Action Scheduler"
(sfdx-mass-action-scheduler) by Doug Ayers (douglascayers.com), archived in 2023:
https://github.com/douglascayers/sfdx-mass-action-scheduler

It was built using the original project's public documentation and behavior as a
functional reference; the object model, field names, and Apex/LWC implementation here are
independently written, not copied from the original source files. As a courtesy to the
original author, and because the two projects solve the same problem, this project's own
code is licensed under the same BSD 3-Clause terms as the original. The original project's
copyright notice and license text are reproduced below unmodified.

